### Example user template template
### Example user template

# IntelliJ project files
.idea
*.iml
.DS_Store
out
gen
/zd-extension.crx
/zd-extension.pem

# Local-only userscript builds (docs/local-mode.md): update from this machine's own file via
# Violentmonkey's "track local file", never from github, so they are never committed.
/zoopdog-nom-ruby-local.user.js
/zoopdog-popupdict-local.user.js

# Source font for the -local nom-ruby build's embedded @font-face (docs/build.md, "Known site
# compatibility limitations"). ~10MB; the committed build keeps loading it from github instead.
/zd-extension/db_src/fonts/

# Built userscripts are published as GitHub Release assets (make release-userscripts), not
# committed. The readable build at the root is the tooling/test contract; dist/ is minified.
/node_modules/
/dist/
/zoopdog-nom-ruby.user.js
/zoopdog-popupdict.user.js
